OL,3,GNEWSAEast West Rail reveals design for
OL,4,Atrain depot
OL,5,
OL,6,FEast West Rail (EWR) has chosen its
OL,7,Fpreferred layout for a maintenance
OL,8,Fdepot it wants to build as part of the
OL,9,Fmulti-billion pound scheme linking
OL,10,FOxford and Cambridge via Milton Keynes.
OL,12,FIt said a bow-tie design would allow
OL,13,Ftrains to enter and leave from either
OL,14,Fdirection at the proposed site near
OL,15,FNewton Longville, Buckinghamshire.
OL,17,FMike Chapman, a parish councillor in
OL,18,FNewton Longville, said residents feel
OL,19,Fthey have not be consulted over the
OL,20,Fplan, particularly those who were at
OL,21,Frisk of losing land to the development.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
